{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grab your friends and compete as adorable capybaras in this fast-paced multiplayer party brawler! Jump on heads, earn points before the timer runs out and dominate the leaderboard across 4 chaotic game modes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Basic Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Try to kill as many enemies as possible.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Keep your head safe!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/72e0f7a653fe6315530ea3e64564b6e4.poster.avif?t=1771881743\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/72e0f7a653fe6315530ea3e64564b6e4.webm?t=1771881743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/72e0f7a653fe6315530ea3e64564b6e4.mp4?t=1771881743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gold Rush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>There is 1 gold coin on the track at all times.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The player who gets it earns 3 points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/fff2eed37d44463be494bb4674b072a2.poster.avif?t=1771881743\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/fff2eed37d44463be494bb4674b072a2.webm?t=1771881743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/fff2eed37d44463be494bb4674b072a2.mp4?t=1771881743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Capture the Flag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Own the flag as long as possible to get valuable points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every 2 seconds, you get 1 point.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/8be7fae8e767e549d6ac3d11ebefe149.poster.avif?t=1771881743\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/8be7fae8e767e549d6ac3d11ebefe149.webm?t=1771881743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/8be7fae8e767e549d6ac3d11ebefe149.mp4?t=1771881743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Floor is Lava</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>It is very simple; if you fall into it, you die after a few seconds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your reward is -1 point, so be very careful where you step.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.a